# Pit of Offerings (turn 1): the graveyard holds Lightning Bolt (red), Ancestral Recall (blue) and Mishra's Bauble (colorless). The land
# enters tapped (CR 614.1c) and its enters trigger exiles all three (up to three target cards, CR 115.1d), linked to it (CR 607.2a). On
# turn 3 "{T}: Add one mana of any of the exiled cards' colors" may add red or blue and nothing else: green is refused beside the red
# that is taken (the positive control), and colorless is not one of the five colors (ruling 2023-11-10). The Pit is untapped on
# turn 3 only because it untapped, having entered tapped on turn 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Lightning Bolt
Ancestral Recall
Mishra's Bauble
Pit of Offerings
